<!-- field: executive_summary -->
## Executive summary

An evaluation platform that scores every agent run against a written rubric and returns the scores to the teams that build the agents.

<!-- field: problem -->
## Problem

Agents ship without a measure of how well they do their tasks, so a regression reaches users before anyone sees it.

<!-- field: what_this_does -->
## What this does

It records each agent run, grades it, and publishes a scorecard per agent and release.

<!-- field: why_we_build_this -->
## Why we build this

A score on every run turns each release into evidence that the agents got better, not a claim.

<!-- field: success_criteria -->
## Success criteria

- scored_runs: every production agent run has a score within a day of the run.
- scorecard_per_release: each release publishes a scorecard for every agent it ships.

<!-- field: not -->
## Not

- A training framework: models are tuned elsewhere, from the scores this platform publishes.

